{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0a7e3ac1-c8fa-89ca-bb6f-09732fa3cc9c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-19T15:06:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Conti",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Kevin. Yeah, hmm, let me see how to say this. My street hasn't been plowed since the storm. Not once. It's just sitting there with the packed stuff from last week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, got it. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm not giving an address on this one, I'm calling for a few buildings, so, um, actually, let me think. I just want to know if someone can send a plow back around. That's all I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for a plow to return. I'll need the street name for the crew though, otherwise I've got nothing to send them to."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:04:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. Right, right. That's fair. It's Third Street, no wait, Second, sorry. Second Street, the stretch near the corner market."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Second Street by the market, writing that down. Plow return, packed snow left from last week. Anything fresh out there today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just a dusting this morning. Nothing much. But it's freezing, so it's all turned to ice ruts. Tenants are sliding all over the place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that cold snap isn't helping anything. Do you want a callback when it's scheduled? I've got a number to enter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0197."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0196, I have that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, 0197. You said six at the end. I heard a six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, my mistake. 0197, seven at the end. Fixed it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Hmm, so when do you figure somebody comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crews are working through the list, so it could be later today or tomorrow. I'll flag it as a repeat pass so it doesn't sit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll take it. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-19T15:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Sal. Stay warm."
    }
  ],
